/.bundle
/vendor/bundle
/.env*
/log/*
/tmp/*
!/log/.keep
!/tmp/.keep
/pkg/
*.gem
/coverage/

# `cafe dev` renders this from anywaye.yml and rewrites it on every run, which its
# own first line says. Build output shaped like a source file: untracked and not
# ignored, it is one `git add -A` from being committed, and from there a merge
# conflict nobody can resolve by reading it — both sides are generated, and the
# manifest neither side was rendered from is not in the diff.
#
# Declared rather than left to accident. `cafe dev` refuses in this repository
# today (a library: no Dockerfile, and the catalog names no image for it), so the
# file is never actually written here. That is a property of this manifest, not
# a reason to leave the path open. anywaye-rb holds no hand-written compose file
# of its own, so there is nothing for this entry to be confused with.
/caf.dev.compose.yaml
keyring/
secrets/
